WEBVTT

00:00:00.573 --> 00:00:01.236
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.177 --> 00:00:03.935
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> You need <b>to be</b> on time.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.360
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Try <b>not to talk</b> too much.

00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:09.981
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.255
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> It’ll be nice <b>to meet</b> new people.

00:00:14.775 --> 00:00:16.967
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> It’s important <b>not to be</b> late.

00:00:18.963 --> 00:00:19.759
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.677 --> 00:00:23.726
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I don’t know where <b>to go</b> or what <b>to do</b>.

00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:26.495
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:29.370
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Why did you wear a suit?

00:00:30.215 --> 00:00:31.680
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> <b>To make</b> a good impression.

00:00:32.882 --> 00:00:35.328
I wore a suit <b>to make</b> a good impression.